    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "\nAUCTION WEDNESDAY 14TH OCTOBER AT 3PM\nIN TRIM CASTLE HOTEL AND ONLINE VIA LSL PLATFORM.\n\nTo register your interest call our office on 046 9431525\n\nLot 1 - House on approx 0.7 ac\nLot 2 - Lands on approx 7 acres\nLot 3 - The Entire\n\nLot 1 - House on 0.7 acres\nSet on approximately 0.70 acres, this attractive detached bungalow enjoys a pleasant countryside setting, conveniently located approximately 3km equidistant from Athboy and Kildalkey.\n\nThe property which was built c. 1942 and extended in 1998 is nicely set back from the main road and is surrounded by mature gardens, offering good privacy and a peaceful setting. A useful range of outbuildings provides excellent additional storage and offers potential for a variety of uses.\n\nThe accommodation comprises a living room, kitchen, three bedrooms, including a main bedroom with ensuite, and a family bathroom.\n\nWith its generous site, mature surroundings and convenient location between Athboy and Kildalkey, this property offers an excellent opportunity for those seeking a comfortable countryside home within easy reach of both villages.\n\nLot 2 - Lands on approx 7 acres\nThe lands which are in grass are in a single diivision with extensive frontage to a fully surfaced cul-de-sac, offering building potential for one or more housing units, subject to planning for local needs. \n \nLot 3 - The Entire."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "<ul><li>OFCH</li><li>Drainage to septic tank</li><li>Mains water</li><li>Detached farm buildings suitable for conversion to loose boxes 17.5m x 4.4m</li><li>2 bay haybarn with leanto 9.4m x 7.3m & 9.3m x 7.5m</li><li>Garage 3.75m x 3.35m</ul>"
